    },
    "Your sensor session ends in about 24 hours. Plan to have a new sensor ready.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "comment": "Alert body for sensor expiring in a day"
    },
    "Your sensor session ends in about 2 hours. Change your sensor soon to avoid a gap in readings.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "comment": "Alert body for sensor expiring soon"
    },
    "Your sensor session has ended and no new readings will arrive. Start a new sensor when you are ready.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "comment": "Alert body for expired sensor"
    },
    "Your sensor stopped working and is not sending readings. Remove it and start a new sensor. Check your glucose with a fingerstick meter in the meantime.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "comment": "Alert body for failed sensor"
    },
    "No readings have arrived for 20 minutes. Keep your phone near your transmitter. If this continues, check your glucose with a fingerstick meter.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "comment": "Alert body for signal loss"
    },
    "Your transmitter is asking for a fingerstick calibration to keep readings accurate.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "comment": "Alert body for calibration request"
    },
    "Your transmitter reaches the end of its life soon. Once it does, your current sensor keeps running but you will not be able to start a new one. Order a replacement now.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "comment": "Alert body for a transmitter nearing end of life"
    },
    "Your transmitter has reached the end of its life. It cannot start a new sensor session. You need a new transmitter to keep using this app for glucose readings.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "comment": "Alert body for an expired transmitter"
    },
    "OK": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "comment": "Alert acknowledgment button label"
    },
    "Dexcom G6 / ONE": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "comment": "Title for the G6SensorKit CGM manager"
    },
    "This transmitter reached the end of its %d-day life on %@ and can no longer start a sensor session. A new transmitter is needed.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "comment": "Explanation when an expired transmitter refuses a session start (1: lifetime days, 2: expiry date)"
    },
    "The transmitter did not accept the start time. Try starting the sensor again.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "comment": "Session start refused as stale"
    },
    "The transmitter did not start a sensor session. Try again, and check that the transmitter is clicked firmly into the sensor holder.": {
