    },
    "Last session for this transmitter": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "comment": "Alert title when a transmitter cannot fit another full session"
    },
    "Your transmitter's battery is getting low. It should finish the sensor you are wearing, but order a replacement transmitter now so you are not caught out.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "comment": "Alert body for a low transmitter battery"
    },
    "Your transmitter's battery is very low and it may stop sending readings at any time, even mid-session. Replace the transmitter as soon as you can, and check your glucose with a fingerstick meter if readings stop.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "comment": "Alert body for a very low transmitter battery"
    },
    "Your transmitter does not have enough life left for another full sensor session after this one. Have a replacement transmitter ready before this sensor ends.": {
